<h2>State EV incentives</h2>
<p>With the federal credits unavailable for a vehicle acquired after September 30, 2025, state, local, and utility programs are the remaining public money. They pause when the funding round ends. Start with the <a href="/guides/ev/ev-tax-credits/">2026 incentives guide</a>, then confirm on the state program’s own site. The <a href="/states/">state directory</a> links the per-state pages we maintain.</p>

